# Env vars for __NAME__-api. BETTER_AUTH_URL (shared with the web app) enables /v1/me token checks.
# Locally `pnpm dev:py` and pytest read apps/web/.env.local, so the
# sidecar shares DATABASE_URL and DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED with the web app. On Vercel both services
# get the project's env vars. Add sidecar-only names here. Never commit real values.
# EXAMPLE_PROVIDER_API_KEY=
